    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Angvik: Returns</strong> is a fan game inspired by the platform action game <strong>Angvik</strong>, which was loved for its unique atmosphere and high difficulty. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While maintaining the original's core philosophy of &quot;only one chance&quot;, it adds a different kind of fun with new content. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the last hope of a fallen kingdom, the player embarks on a journey to reclaim the lost legacy and restore the balance of the world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unknown creatures, dangerous terrain, and various weapons and items that can be obtained through exploration await you along the way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don't let your guard down. With only one life, you must survive until the end.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Key Features]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 6 unique classes: Play with different weapons and strategies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- New level design: Different map composition and terrain traps from the original</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Various enemies and boss monsters: New enemies and attack patterns that are different from the original add to the tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Exploration and rewards: Find hidden artifacts and equipment throughout the map to strengthen your abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Leaderboard: Register your name and country on the leaderboard with quick and accurate play.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Angvik: Returns</strong> is a fan game inspired by the platform action game <strong>Angvik</strong>, which was loved for its unique atmosphere and high difficulty. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While maintaining the original's core philosophy of &quot;only one chance&quot;, it adds a different kind of fun with new content. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the last hope of a fallen kingdom, the player embarks on a journey to reclaim the lost legacy and restore the balance of the world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unknown creatures, dangerous terrain, and various weapons and items that can be obtained through exploration await you along the way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don't let your guard down. With only one life, you must survive until the end.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Key Features]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 6 unique classes: Play with different weapons and strategies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- New level design: Different map composition and terrain traps from the original</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Various enemies and boss monsters: New enemies and attack patterns that are different from the original add to the tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Exploration and rewards: Find hidden artifacts and equipment throughout the map to strengthen your abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Leaderboard: Register your name and country on the leaderboard with quick and accurate play.</p>",
